<rss version="2.0" xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/"><channel><title>救生艇新闻：博客——保护人类</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/</link><description></description><lastBuildDate>Thu, 10 Sep 2026 01:51:13 GMT</lastBuildDate><generator>rfeed v1.1.1</generator><docs>https://github.com/svpino/rfeed/blob/master/README.md</docs><item><title>GPT-6 Astra、环形变压器和隐藏推理</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/gpt-6-astra-looped-transformers-and-hidden-reasoning</link><description>看看循环深度、隐藏的思想链以及循环变压器块的最新研究&lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/gpt-6-astra-looped-transformers-and-hidden-reasoning2.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Thu, 10 Sep 2026 01:51:11 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/gpt-6-astra-looped-transformers-and-hidden-reasoning</guid></item><item><title>谷歌 DeepMind 发布人工智能预测，预测人类 DNA 中所有 90 亿种可能的单点突变的影响</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/google-deepmind-publishes-aipowered-predictions-for-the-effect-of-all-9-billion-possible-singlepoint-mutations-to-human-dna</link><description>DeepMind 预测 DNA 突变影响的目录可以帮助科学家解开罕见遗传疾病的原因并帮助他们找到治疗方法。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/google-deepmind-publishes-aipowered-predictions-for-the-effect-of-all-9-billion-possible-singlepoint-mutations-to-human-dna2.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Thu, 10 Sep 2026 01:36:11 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/google-deepmind-publishes-aipowered-predictions-for-the-effect-of-all-9-billion-possible-singlepoint-mutations-to-human-dna</guid></item><item><title>科学家关闭了老鼠的意识。然后他们的大脑开始疯狂</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/scientists-turned-off-consciousness-in-rats-then-their-brains-started-going-wild</link><description>清醒时大脑进行微调的电活动在麻醉下变得更加混乱。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/scientists-turned-off-consciousness-in-rats-then-their-brains-started-going-wild.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Thu, 10 Sep 2026 01:21:11 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/scientists-turned-off-consciousness-in-rats-then-their-brains-started-going-wild</guid></item><item><title>我们经济未来的情景</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/scenarios-for-our-economic-future</link><description>人择经济学团队模拟了人工智能对 2030 年经济的影响。&lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/scenarios-for-our-economic-future.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Thu, 10 Sep 2026 01:06:11 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/scenarios-for-our-economic-future</guid></item><item><title>Chainofthought 可监控性正在下降 OpenAI 承认无法赶上 GPT6 Astra</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/chainofthought-monitorability-is-decliningopenai-admits-it-cant-catch-gpt6-astra</link><description>Openai 承认 GPT-6 astra 中的思想链可监控性正在下降。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/chainofthought-monitorability-is-decliningopenai-admits-it-cant-catch-gpt6-astra.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Thu, 10 Sep 2026 00:51:11 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/chainofthought-monitorability-is-decliningopenai-admits-it-cant-catch-gpt6-astra</guid></item><item><title>科学家为实体瘤设计了即用型抗癌 T 细胞</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/scientists-engineer-ready-to-use-cancer-fighting-t-cells-for-solid-tumors</link><description>T 细胞受体 (TCR) 疗法是一种癌症治疗方法，可对称为 T 细胞的免疫细胞进行基因重新编程，以精确地捕获癌症。它与另一种治疗方法 CAR T 细胞疗法类似，但有一个关键区别：CAR T 细胞疗法只能发现癌细胞外部自然出现的蛋白质。然而，TCR 疗法还可以捕获细胞内部的小蛋白质片段，这些片段被带到表面并像小名字标签一样展示。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/scientists-engineer-ready-to-use-cancer-fighting-t-cells-for-solid-tumors2.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Wed, 09 Sep 2026 15:28:25 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/scientists-engineer-ready-to-use-cancer-fighting-t-cells-for-solid-tumors</guid></item><item><title>Jamelle Lindo 谈人工智能时代的情商：驾驭情感的力量</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/jamelle-lindo-on-emotional-intelligence-in-the-age-of-ai-harness-the-power-of-emotion</link><description>&lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/jamelle-lindo-on-emotional-intelligence-in-the-age-of-ai-harness-the-power-of-emotion.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Wed, 09 Sep 2026 15:13:25 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/jamelle-lindo-on-emotional-intelligence-in-the-age-of-ai-harness-the-power-of-emotion</guid></item><item><title>为什么 GLP1 可能成为抗衰老突破</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/why-glp1s-could-be-an-antiaging-breakthrough</link><description>糖尿病药物对心脏、肾脏和大脑显示出惊人的益处。现在，令人兴奋的动物研究表明它们可能会影响衰老本身的生物学。&lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/why-glp1s-could-be-an-antiaging-breakthrough.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Wed, 09 Sep 2026 14:58:25 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/why-glp1s-could-be-an-antiaging-breakthrough</guid></item><item><title>人类视频机器人训练：Dyna 的 1 百万小时突破提出了正确的问题</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/human-video-robot-training-dynas-1mhour-breakthrough-raises-the-right-questions</link><description>Dyna Robotics 于 2026 年 8 月 10 日推出了 DYNA-2，这是一个世界动作模型，经过超过 100 万小时的人类以自我为中心的视频训练，大约有 170 年的连续经验，在预训练过程中使用的机器人数据为零。人类视频机器人训练让 Dyna 报告在高精度制造任务上的任务成功率从 20% 上升到 80-90%。所有这些数据都来自 Dyna 自己的测试，而不是独立的基准测试，这正是它们值得与任何其他供应商报告的结果相同的审查的原因。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/human-video-robot-training-dynas-1mhour-breakthrough-raises-the-right-questions.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Wed, 09 Sep 2026 14:43:25 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/human-video-robot-training-dynas-1mhour-breakthrough-raises-the-right-questions</guid></item><item><title>ASTRID 追踪 135 亿年的黑洞和星系演化</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/astrid-traces-13-5-billion-years-of-black-hole-and-galaxy-evolution</link><description>在夜晚的黑暗天空中，遥远的星光闪烁，诉说着几乎与时间本身一样古老的浩瀚宇宙历史。来自美国宇航局詹姆斯·韦伯太空望远镜等仪器的新数据正在帮助天体物理学家探索深奥的宇宙奥秘，包括黑洞和星系的演化。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/astrid-traces-13-5-billion-years-of-black-hole-and-galaxy-evolution2.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Wed, 09 Sep 2026 14:28:25 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/astrid-traces-13-5-billion-years-of-black-hole-and-galaxy-evolution</guid></item></channel></rss>